  "description": "PostgreSQL and pgvector storage for Mythosia VectorDb with Cosine, Euclidean and InnerProduct similarity, jsonb metadata filters, text-only retrieval and configurable normalized weighted RRF. Uses persisted full-text indexing and optional pg_trgm word_similarity for keyword search, including CJK text. Provides batch retrieval, counts, HNSW/IVFFlat/NoIndex settings, connection verification and schema provisioning. What's New in v10.8.1: Mixed hybrid search honors configured HNSW EfSearch and IVFFlat Probes on the same connection and transaction as the search query.",
