  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.8.1: Fixes mixed hybrid search ignoring configured HNSW EfSearch and IVFFlat Probes. Runtime settings now apply on the same connection and transaction as the search query, matching ordinary vector search without leaking to later pooled-connection queries. Text-only search remains unaffected. Approximate search and filtering can still return fewer than topK results. No public API changes, schema migration or reindexing required when upgrading from 10.8.0. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/vectordb/Mythosia.VectorDb.Postgres/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v1081",
